WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
STC10 robots between stamping presses.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Transfer between adjacent press stations.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.500
End-of-arm tooling enters the die area
to pick and place the workpiece.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:20.090
Robot transfer and press cycles alternate.
The tooling clears the die before pressing.
